# Next.js proxy convention

- Next.js 16+ renamed `middleware` → `proxy`. Do not create or revive `middleware.ts`.
- File: `proxy.ts` at the project root (same level as `app/`).
- Export: `export async function proxy(request: NextRequest)` (or default export named accordingly).
- `export const config.matcher` still works the same way.
- Codemod if needed: `npx @next/codemod@canary middleware-to-proxy .`
